flowchart TD
  Reviewers[Invited reviewers and BA] --> Edge[HTTPS domain and access controls]
  Edge --> Web[Railway ERP web]
  Web --> DB[(Dedicated ERP PostgreSQL volume)]
  Web --> Objects[Private ERP object storage]
